<title>Iran and the regional confrontation: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/iran/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-iran-2026-11-16T11:50:32.210Z</guid>
<pubDate>Mon, 16 Nov 2026 11:50:32 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Iran has launched a second drone attack on the U.S. base in Bahrain and added a missile strike on a building in Tel Aviv, prompting the United States to strike Iran's Qeshm Island and disable a commercial vessel in the Gulf of Oman. Iran also opened a women’s war-readiness training camp, labeled the Argentine navy and air force as terrorist organisations, and warned of retaliation against European bases hosting U.S. forces. In Yemen, Houthi forces advanced as Saudi-backed forces retreated from Aden, gaining control of a key strait. A third U.S. aircraft carrier arrived in the Middle East amid the heightened tension. 123 battle-related deaths were recorded in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.france24.com/en/middle-east/20261115-yemen-houthis-advance-to-within-60-kilometres-of-aden-military-sources-say&quot;&gt;France 24&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.euronews.com/2026/11/16/us-and-iran-slide-closer-to-fresh-all-out-war-as-new-exchange-of-fire-increases&quot;&gt;Euronews&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.aljazeera.com/video/newsfeed/2026/11/16/third-us-aircraft-carrier-arrives-in-middle-east-amid-tensions-with-iran?traffic_source=rss&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/16/world/europe/iran-dams-missile-sites-environmentalists.html&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.france24.com/en/video/20261116-yemen-s-houthis-advance-on-aden-as-govt-bolsters-defences&quot;&gt;France 24&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cqvg2xgyvnjpo?at_medium=RSS&amp;amp;at_campaign=rss&quot;&gt;BBC News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Times of Israel&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.